  "summary": "Warsh disclosed 60 transactions between May 27, 2026, and June 23, 2026, consisting of 59 sales (estimated $43.7 million) and one purchase (estimated $175,000). Fifty-two of the 60 rows were sales of numbered series of THSDFS LLC; the rest were sales of Bessemer Venture Associates funds, Lansing Management Onshore LP, DCM Investments and stakes in the startups Aven and Hebbia. The single purchase was an exercise of vested Aven stock options, paired with a same-day sale of the resulting stock valued between $1,000,001 and $5,000,000. Ten sales fell in the filing's largest reported range, $1,000,001 to $5,000,000. None of the 60 transactions were late-filed.",
